<view class="page-shell progress-page">
  <page-header
    eyebrow="累计学习情况"
    title="学习进度"
    detail="英语（二）· 目标60分"
  ></page-header>

  <view class="section-card card">
    <view class="section-head"><text>云端同步</text><text>{{sync.text}}</text></view>
    <text class="backup-note" wx:if="{{!sync.enabled}}">首次请在手机上开启，以本机现有进度建立云端存档；电脑微信随后自动读取。同一微信账号共用进度。</text>
    <text class="backup-note" wx:else>最后成功同步：{{sync.last || '尚无'}}。本地先保存，联网后自动同步；显示“已同步”才代表当前记录已上传。</text>
    <text class="backup-note" wx:if="{{sync.pending}}">还有 {{sync.pending}} 项变化待上传，请勿删除小程序或清缓存。</text>
    <text class="backup-note" wx:if="{{syncError}}">{{syncError}}</text>
    <button class="secondary-button" loading="{{syncBusy}}" disabled="{{syncBusy}}" bindtap="syncNow">{{sync.enabled ? '立即同步' : '用本机进度开启同步'}}</button>
  </view>

  <view class="section-card card recovery-card" wx:if="{{!stats.learned || recoveryOpen || recoveryStatus}}">
    <view class="section-head"><text>缓存清空后，补回已学进度</text></view>
    <text class="backup-note">无备份时可按机构学习日补回已学范围，不必从头学。无法找回旧答题历史、收藏和易忘清单，也不会把补回词标成已掌握。</text>
    <button class="secondary-button" wx:if="{{!recoveryOpen && !recoveryStatus}}" bindtap="toggleRecovery">选择已学到哪里</button>
    <view wx:if="{{recoveryOpen}}">
      <picker range="{{recoveryLabels}}" value="{{recoveryIndex}}" bindchange="onRecoveryDay"><view class="recovery-picker">学习日：{{recoveryLabels[recoveryIndex]}} ▾</view></picker>
      <picker range="{{recoveryCounts}}" value="{{recoveryCount}}" bindchange="onRecoveryCount"><view class="recovery-picker">{{recoveryCounts[recoveryCount]}} ▾</view></picker>
      <text class="backup-note">所选范围 {{recoveryPreview.total}} 词，需补回 {{recoveryPreview.added}} 词；按每天 {{recoveryBatch}} 词分批到期，计入每日复习上限，不一次堆到今天。已有记录不会覆盖，主动复习仍可随时加练。</text>
      <button class="primary-button" bindtap="recoverProgress">补回已学范围</button>
    </view>
    <view class="backup-result" wx:if="{{recoveryStatus}}"><text>{{recoveryStatus}}</text></view>
  </view>

  <view class="progress-card card">
    <view class="progress-head"><text>已学习 {{stats.learned}} / {{stats.total}}</text><text class="muted">{{progress}}%</text></view>
    <view class="progress-track"><view style="width: {{progress}}%"></view></view>
    <text class="progress-note">按当前节奏，首轮预计{{firstRoundEstimate}}完成</text>
  </view>

  <view class="summary-grid">
    <view class="card"><text>{{stats.stable}}</text><text>稳定记得</text></view>
    <view class="card"><text>{{stats.learning}}</text><text>学习中</text></view>
    <view class="card"><text>{{stats.weak}}</text><text>易忘词</text></view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-card card">
    <view class="section-head"><text>近7天完成情况</text></view>
    <view class="week-chart">
      <view class="day-column" wx:for="{{week}}" wx:key="key">
        <view class="day-track"><view class="day-fill {{item.status}}" style="height: {{item.height}}%"></view></view>
        <text>{{item.label}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <text class="legend">绿色：完成　橙色：部分完成　灰色：未学习</text>
  </view>

  <view class="section-card card">
    <view class="section-head"><text>近7天学习质量</text></view>
    <view class="quality-row"><text>到期复习完成率</text><text>{{dueCompletionRate}}%</text></view>
    <view class="quality-row"><text>新词首次能认出</text><text>{{firstRecognitionRate}}%</text></view>
    <view class="quality-row"><text>当前易忘词</text><text>{{stats.weak}}词</text></view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-card card">
    <view class="section-head"><text>词表进度</text></view>
    <view class="source-row"><view><text>核心词汇</text><text>9天 · {{stats.coreTotal}}条</text></view><text>{{stats.coreLearned}} / {{stats.coreTotal}}</text></view>
    <view class="source-row"><view><text>高频词汇</text><text>42天 · {{stats.highTotal}}条</text></view><text>{{stats.highLearned}} / {{stats.highTotal}}</text></view>
  </view>

  <view class="section-card card backup-card">
    <view class="section-head"><text>本地数据备份</text></view>
    <text class="backup-note">云端成功同步的记录可跨设备恢复；尚未同步的本地变化仍可能随清缓存丢失。下方保留可选的独立文件备份。</text>
    <button class="text-restore-button" wx:if="{{stats.learned && !recoveryOpen}}" bindtap="toggleRecovery">无备份？按学习日补回已学范围</button>
    <view class="backup-actions">
      <button class="secondary-button" loading="{{backupBusy}}" disabled="{{backupBusy}}" bindtap="exportBackup">导出备份</button>
      <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="importBackup">恢复备份</button>
    </view>
    <view class="backup-result" wx:if="{{backupStatus}}"><text selectable>{{backupStatus}}</text></view>
    <view class="backup-actions" wx:if="{{backupReady}}">
      <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="sendBackupFile">发送备份文件</button>
      <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="copyBackupText">复制备份文本</button>
    </view>
    <button class="text-restore-button" bindtap="toggleTextRestore">{{restoreTextOpen ? '收起文本恢复' : '用备份文本恢复'}}</button>
    <view wx:if="{{restoreTextOpen}}">
      <textarea class="restore-text" value="{{restoreText}}" bindinput="onRestoreText" maxlength="-1" placeholder="在此粘贴之前保存的完整备份文本" />
      <button class="secondary-button" bindtap="restoreFromText">检查并恢复</button>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
